0003-dafsa-honours-source-date-epoch.patch
Reproducible build.

diff --git a/src/psl-make-dafsa b/src/psl-make-dafsa
index 4267fe23bb224a7f35f1576411baf57d4a7c0306..68ba7a11a71852b818fc4141eb1a1e80f0cd949b 100755
--- a/src/psl-make-dafsa
